{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32369","headline":"宿松门寺 · 温庭筠","name":"宿松门寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白石青崖世界分，卷帘孤坐对氛氲。\n林间禅室春深雪，潭上龙堂夜半云。\n落月苍凉登阁在，晓钟摇荡隔江闻。\n西山旧是经行地，愿漱寒缾逐领军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}